# HabitTracker — Project Stack

- Kotlin
- Android
- MVVM
- Clean Architecture
- Hilt (dependency injection)
- Room
- Retrofit
- Coroutines
- Flow
- Material 3
- Jetpack Compose
- Type-safe Navigation (kotlinx.serialization)

# UI

- All screens are Compose-based.
- No XML unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer Jetpack Compose for new screens.
- Do not migrate screens to XML.

# Package structure

- `view/` — UI screens, components, navigation
- `domain/` — use cases, repository interfaces, models
- `data/` — repository implementations, Room, network
- `di/` — Hilt modules
